      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 3485277014,
          "type": null,
          "body": "CMake can be used to do cross-builds; should this check for that and do the test only with native builds?\n\nAlso, should we construct a short pcap file, separate from the files used for testing, so that, if the testing files are ever changed, the test doesn't break? (\"Construct\" here could mean either 1) construct it ahead of time and check it in or 2) construct it on the fly in the CMake script.)",
